# A string built by interpolation for a target that can only be met through regex containment (#20).
-- source.cue --
a!: string
-- target.cue --
id!: =~"^[a-z]+$"
-- lens.cue --
v0_0: _
v1_0: {id: "x\(v0_0.a)"}
-- out --
unknown
v1_0.id is a string built by "x\(v0_0.a)", and the target schema accepts only some strings (=~"^[a-z]+$"); the checker does not reason about string contents: make the target accept any string, or copy a field the target already constrains (rule unknown-target-constraint) @ lens.cue:2:12
